        "text": "Ravin and Khushi meet through a matrimonial website and begin getting to know one another at a distance. Calls and messages gradually turn an initial introduction into a relationship, and they start imagining a future together. Drawing on the author's own experience, the novel follows the hopes and emotional vulnerability that accompany their plans. Their story confronts the possibility that a deeply felt love may not have the ending the couple expects.",
