        "text": "Ryū Murakami depicts a circle of young friends living in a Japanese town near an American military base. Drug use, sexual encounters and episodes of violence shape their routines and strain their connections with one another. The novel uses sharply focused physical sensations and fragmented experiences to portray their unstable world. Its subject is the destructive pattern of these lives and the difficulty of finding a lasting sense of connection.",
